  "mapLabel": "The Hoysalas, about 1026 to 1343 CE",
  "note": "Based on Hoysala inscriptions, the temples themselves, the Persian chroniclers of Delhi and Ibn Battuta. The tiger story is tradition, and early dates and the king’s conversion are debated. The map is stylised and not to scale.",
